---
import Layout from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import AudioExamples from "../components/AudioExamples.astro";
import { site } from "../content";
---

<Layout>
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="quadrants wrap">
    <section class="quadrant totem-quadrant" id="totem" aria-labelledby="totem-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span>01</span> Totem / The idea</p>
      <h1 id="totem-heading">AI for<br /><em>state transitions.</em></h1>
      <p class="intro">Move from the state you’re in toward the state you choose.</p>
      <p>You choose the goal. AI drives the transition—developing a vocabulary of words, sound, and rhythm to help you move toward it.</p>
      <div class="state-path" aria-label="Current state, then adaptive signal, then chosen state">
        <span>Current state</span><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>Adaptive signal</span><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>Chosen state</span>
      </div>
      <a class="card-link" href="/totem/">Explore Totem <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>

    <section class="quadrant examples-quadrant" id="signals" aria-labelledby="examples-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span>02</span> Examples / Listen</p>
      <h2 id="examples-heading">Hear the signal.</h2>
      <p>Three early compositions exploring a transition from boredom toward building.</p>
      <AudioExamples />
      <p class="note">40 seconds each. Prototype recordings; their effects have not yet been established.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="/examples/">Explore the recordings <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>

    <section class="quadrant mind-quadrant" id="observer" aria-labelledby="mind-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span>03</span> Synthetic mind / Feedback</p>
      <h2 id="mind-heading"><strong>Epignos</strong></h2>
      <p class="intro">Meta Mind for the Minds!</p>
      <p>Understanding how minds change. A synthetic mind to observe state transitions and give Totem feedback.</p>
      <div class="feedback-path" aria-label="Proposed feedback loop: Totem, transition, synthetic observer, feedback to Totem">
        <span>Totem</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>Transition</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>Observer</span><span class="feedback-return">↳ Feedback to Totem</span>
      </div>
      <p class="research-note"><span class="status-dot"></span> Research in development</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="/synthetic-mind/">Explore the observer <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>

    <section class="quadrant quote-quadrant" id="idea" aria-label="The principle and links">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span>04</span> The point of return</p>
      <blockquote>“The mantra is the path.<br />The totem is the destination.”</blockquote>
      <p class="attribution">Sumanth · <cite>The Reflective Totem</cite></p>
      <nav class="resource-links" aria-label="Explore more">
        <a href={site.epinote}>EpiNote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a href="https://x.com/Sumanth_n83">Writing on X <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
      <a class="card-link" href="/principle/">Read the principle <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
